      "source": "This class wraps an existing <a href=\"../ToolCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallback</code></a> and modifies its input schema to\ninclude additional fields defined in the provided Record type. It also provides a\nmechanism to handle these extended arguments, either by consuming them via a provided\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> or by removing them from the input after processing.",
      "translation": "该类包装了现有的 <a href=\"../ToolCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool\"><code>ToolCallback</code></a>，并将其输入模式修改为包含在提供的 Record 类型中定义的额外字段。此外，它还提供了一种机制来处理这些扩展参数：可以通过提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> 来消费它们，也可以在处理后从输入中移除它们。",
      "count": 1
    },
